*Update this list when a token is added or fractured. Keep count note in sync with DESIGN. Prefer granular tokens in new APIs. CAP-G1/G2 preferred maps are path-A process-local seal contracts. CAP-G3 is residual-only honesty (exact require stubs; **no** HW/UI product ops). CAP-G3 inject path-A landed. CAP-G4 ProcessCap path-A FIXED. CAP-G5: process-local only (no product seccomp). **CAP-G6 FIXED net+fs product facades + ProcessCap product facades** (spawn/exec/wait/kill + async spawn); **python stays SysCap**; **DNS residual FIXED** (`resolve_ipv4` → UdpCap; socket DNS still residual Err); **batch_2 five-file net claim is phantom** (no `dns_server` et al. on disk); **SysCap bulk residual** named in `audit/cap_g6_syscap_inventory.oot` — do not greenwash full std least-privilege. Close: `audit/cap_process_facade_rollup.oot` + `audit/cap_dns_udp_rollup.oot`.*
